    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits disclosure of documents that could have a substantial adverse effect on the economy.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A document is conditionally exempt if its disclosure under this Act would, or could be reasonably expected to, have a substantial adverse effect on Australia’s economy.";
